# =====================================================================
#  OMF2097-3DO — .gitignore
#
#  Golden rule: this repo ships ONLY our own source. It must NEVER contain
#  (a) assets derived from OMF:2097 (c) Diversions Entertainment, nor
#  (b) 3DO system/SDK boot files (c) The 3DO Company / Trapexit devkit.
#  Both are regenerated/sourced locally — see README.md.
#
#  NOTE: git does not support inline comments — keep '#' on its own line.
# =====================================================================

# --- Local tooling / machine-specific config ---
.claude/
*.log

# generated by build.ps1 (embeds local WSL paths)
port_3do/.build-driver.sh

# --- Build outputs ---
port_3do/build/
port_3do/host_tools/build/
port_3do/iso/
port_3do/takeme/LaunchMe

# --- OMF:2097-DERIVED assets (copyrighted — never commit) ---
# Whole ISO filesystem: Art/ + Music/ (from OMF data) and System/ (3DO SDK).
port_3do/takeme/

# neutral-atlas backups + sentinel staging (derived)
port_3do/palette_staging/

# decoded OMF music previews (~140 MB of WAV)
bgm_preview/

# Generated C data headers — regenerated by host_tools/ pipeline from OMF data
*_data.h
*_meta.h

# Generated 3DO / audio / image artifacts (defense-in-depth, anywhere in tree)
*.CEL
*.cel
*.ATL
*.PAL
*.AIFF
*.aiff
*.aif
*.iso
*.wav

# backup variants of the above (e.g. *.ATL.neutral.bak)
*.bak

# --- Compiled objects / binaries ---
*.o
*.a
*.obj
*.exe
# stray object tree the host_tools Makefile writes next to the openomf sources
port_3do/openomf-master/

# --- Internal planning notes (kept local; the public story lives in DEVLOG.md) ---
port_3do/SESSIONE7_MENU_SCOPE.md
port_3do/MILESTONE_1V1.md

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
